# BABA ON FLAG IS POWER, POWERED ROCK IS PUSH → ROCK is pushable when BABA stands on FLAG.
# BABA and FLAG share (5,5), making BABA have POWER via ON condition.
# POWERED ROCK IS PUSH then fires, making ROCK at (6,5) pushable.
# BABA IS YOU moves right, pushing ROCK from (6,5) to (7,5).

[setup]
version 1
name "powered with on-conditional power source"

text 0 0 baba
text 1 0 on
text 2 0 flag
text 3 0 is
text 4 0 power

text 0 1 powered
text 1 1 rock
text 2 1 is
text 3 1 push

text 0 2 baba
text 1 2 is
text 2 2 you

object 5 5 baba right
object 5 5 flag right
object 6 5 rock right

[inputs]
input right

[expected]
at 6 5 baba
at 7 5 rock
not_at 6 5 rock
tick 1
not_won
